        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Explore a vast, living world teeming with vibrant towns, ancient ruins, and untold mysteries waiting beyond every horizon.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Slay evil dragons and monsters, conquer the forces of darkness threatening to consume the world.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Gather legendary weapons, master forbidden magics, and uncover the long-lost secrets of your bloodline. Experience an epic tale of courage, friendship, betrayal, and destiny written in the fires of battle.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the Demon Lord</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145190/extras/0890a6f8ee128a2b0a31742d40bb839a.avif?t=1768755536\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty scaling systems are not functioning. While you’re at level 1 and unarmed, the Demon Lord has every ability and bullet-hell pattern you were only meant to face at the very end of your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaches in the game’s core systems have been detected. She may have gained admin access and privileges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contingency protocols will kick in soon. Ones that can override even her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always respawn, she cannot. You just need to kill her once. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Explore a vast, living world teeming with vibrant towns, ancient ruins, and untold mysteries waiting beyond every horizon.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Slay evil dragons and monsters, conquer the forces of darkness threatening to consume the world.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Gather legendary weapons, master forbidden magics, and uncover the long-lost secrets of your bloodline. Experience an epic tale of courage, friendship, betrayal, and destiny written in the fires of battle.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the Demon Lord</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145190/extras/0890a6f8ee128a2b0a31742d40bb839a.avif?t=1768755536\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty scaling systems are not functioning. While you’re at level 1 and unarmed, the Demon Lord has every ability and bullet-hell pattern you were only meant to face at the very end of your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaches in the game’s core systems have been detected. She may have gained admin access and privileges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contingency protocols will kick in soon. Ones that can override even her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always respawn, she cannot. You just need to kill her once. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Instead of waiting at the end of your adventure, the Demon Lord decided to fight you right at the very beginning. Not very sporting of her... Pretty sure she broke a few rules. She can’t keep this up forever. Kill the anomaly.",
